: false, "format": "string", "formatlabel": "{0:d} ph\u00fat", "type": "spinner"}, "default": 3, "enabled": true, "help": "\u0110\u1eb7t th\u1eddi gian ch\u1edd \u0111\u1ee3i cho b\u1ea5t k\u1ef3 ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng n\u00e0o x\u1ea3y ra tr\u01b0\u1edbc khi hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb tr\u00ecnh b\u1ea3o v\u1ec7 m\u00e0n h\u00ecnh.", "id": "screensaver.time", "label": "Th\u1eddi gian ch\u1edd", "level": "basic", "maximum": 60, "minimum": 1, "parent": "", "step": 1, "type": "integer", "value": 3}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "boolean", "type": "toggle"}, "default": true, "enabled": true, "help": "If music is being played, the screensaver will never be activated", "id": "screensaver.disableforaudio", "label": "Disable screensaver when playing audio", "level": "basic", "parent": "", "type": "boolean", "value": true}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "boolean", "type": "toggle"}, "default": true, "enabled": false, "help": "L\u00e0m m\u1edd m\u00e0n h\u00ecnh khi \u0111a ph\u01b0\u01a1ng ti\u1ec7n b\u1ecb t\u1ea1m d\u1eebng. Kh\u00f4ng h\u1ee3p l\u1ec7 cho ch\u1ebf \u0111\u1ed9 b\u1ea3o v\u1ec7 m\u00e0n h\u00ecnh \"Dim\".", "id": "screensaver.usedimonpause", "label": "L\u00e0m t\u1ed1i m\u00e0n h\u00ecnh n\u1ebfu t\u1ea1m d\u1eebng trong l\u00fac ph\u00e1t", "level": "standard", "parent": "", "type": "boolean", "value": true}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "action", "type": "button"}, "data": "", "enabled": true, "help": "T\u1ea1i \u0111\u00e2y b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 b\u1eadt ho\u1eb7c t\u1eaft kh\u00f3a ch\u00ednh v\u00e0 x\u00e1c \u0111\u1ecbnh m\u00e3 PIN \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng \u0111\u1ec3 m\u1edf kh\u00f3a. B\u1ea1n c\u0169ng c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 ch\u1ec9 \u0111\u1ecbnh khu v\u1ef1c n\u00e0o c\u1ee7a \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng s\u1ebd c\u1ea7n m\u00e3 PIN \u0111\u1ec3 truy c\u1eadp ch\u00fang.", "id": "masterlock.lockcode", "label": "M\u00e3 kh\u00f3a ch\u00ednh v\u00e0 c\u00e0i \u0111\u1eb7t", "level": "standard", "parent": "", "typ