cnh qu\u00e9t.", "id": "videolibrary.backgroundupdate", "label": "\u1ea8n qu\u00e1 tr\u00ecnh c\u1eadp nh\u1eadt th\u01b0 vi\u1ec7n", "level": "standard", "parent": "", "type": "boolean", "value": false}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "boolean", "type": "toggle"}, "default": true, "enabled": true, "help": "Select scanner action for different video versions.[CR][Enabled] Add different video versions to library seperately without confirmation.[CR][Disabled] Prompt for converting different video versions into additional versions of the original.", "id": "videolibrary.ignorevideoversions", "label": "Ignore different video versions on scan", "level": "standard", "parent": "", "type": "boolean", "value": true}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "boolean", "type": "toggle"}, "default": true, "enabled": true, "help": "Select scanner action for video extras in \"extras\" folder.[CR][Enabled] Scan video extras like regular videos.[CR][Disabled] Add video extras to library for associated video.", "id": "videolibrary.ignorevideoextras", "label": "Ignore video extras on scan", "level": "standard", "parent": "", "type": "boolean", "value": true}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "action", "type": "button"}, "data": "", "enabled": true, "help": "X\u00f3a m\u1ee5c kh\u1ecfi th\u01b0 vi\u1ec7n c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n n\u1ebfu kh\u00f4ng th\u1ec3 t\u00ecm th\u1ea5y (\u0111\u00e3 b\u1ecb \u0111\u1ed5i t\u00ean, b\u1ecb x\u00f3a ho\u1eb7c tr\u00ean th\u1ebb nh\u1edb ch\u01b0a \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c c\u1eafm).", "id": "videolibrary.cleanup", "label": "X\u00f3a th\u01b0 vi\u1ec7n", "level": "advanced", "parent": "", "type": "action"}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "action", "type": "button"}, "data": "", "enabled": true, "help": "Xu\u1ea5t c\u01a1 s\u1edf d\u1eef li\u1ec7u th\u01b0 vi\u1ec7n video sang t\u1eadp tin XML. \u0110i\u1ec1u n\u00e0y s\u1ebd t\u00f9y \u00fd ghi \u0111\u00e8 l\u00ean t\u1eadp tin XML hi\u1ec7n t\u1ea1i c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n.", "id": "videolibrary.export", "label": "Xu\u1ea5t th\u01b0 vi\u1ec7n", "level": "advanced", "parent": "", "type": "action"}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "action", "type": "button"}, "data": "", "enabled": true, "help": "Nh\u1eadp t\u1eadp tin XML v\u00e0o c\u01a1 s\u1edf d\u1eef li\u1ec7u th\u01b0 vi\u1ec7n video.", "id": "videolibrary.import", "label": "Nh\u1eadp th\u01b0 vi\u1ec7n", "level": "advanced", "parent": "", "type": "action"}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "boolean", "type": "toggle"}, "default": false, "enabled": true, "help": "Ki\u1ec3m tra c\u00e1c t\u1eadp tin ph\u01b0\u01a1ng ti\u1ec7n m\u1edbi v\u00e0 lo\u1ea1i b\u1ecf khi kh\u1edfi \u0111\u1ed9ng.", "id": "musiclibrary.updateonstartup", "label": "C\u1eadp nh\u1eadt th\u01b0 vi\u1ec7n khi kh\u1edfi \u0111\u1ed9ng", "level": "standard", "parent": "", "type": "boolean", "value": false}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "boolean", "type": "toggle"}, "default": false, "enabled": true, "help": "\u1ea8n thanh ti\u1ebfn tr\u00ecnh qu\u00e9t th\u01b0 vi\u1ec7n trong qu\u00e1 tr\u00ecnh qu\u00e9t.", "id": "musiclibrary.backgroundupdate", "label": "\u1ea8n qu\u00e1 tr\u00ecnh c\u1eadp nh\u1eadt th\u01b0 vi\u1ec7n", "level": "standard", "parent": "", "type": "boolean", "value": false}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "action", "type": "button"}, "data": "", "enabled": true, "help": "X\u00f3a m\u1ee5c kh\u1ecfi th\u01b0 vi\u1ec7n c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n n\u1ebfu kh\u00f4ng th\u1ec3 t\u00ecm th\u1ea5y (\u0111\u00e3 b\u1ecb \u0111\u1ed5i t\u00ean, b\u1ecb x\u00f3a ho\u1eb7c tr\u00ean th\u1ebb nh\u1edb ch\u01b0a \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c c\u1eafm).", "id": "musiclibrary.cleanup", "label": "X\u00f3a th\u01b0 vi\u1ec7n", "level": "advanced", "parent": "", "type": "action"}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "action", "type": "button"}, "data": "", "enabled": true, "help": "Xu\u1ea5t c\u00e1c ph\u1ea7n c\u1ee7a th\u01b0 vi\u1ec7n nh\u1ea1c sang t\u1eadp tin XML ho\u1eb7c t\u1ec7p NFO. \u0110i\u1ec1u n\u00e0y s\u1ebd t\u00f9y \u00fd ghi \u0111\u00e8 l\u00ean c\u00e1c t\u1eadp tin NFO v\u00e0 t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt hi\u1ec7n t\u1ea1i c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n.", "id": "musiclibrary.export", "label": "Xu\u1ea5t th\u01b0 vi\u1ec7n", "level": "advanced", "parent": "", "type": "action"}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "action", "type": "button"}, "data": "", "enabled": true, "help": "Nh\u1eadp t\u1eadp tin XML v\u00e0o c\u01a1 s\u1edf d\u1eef li\u1ec7u th\u01b0 vi\u1ec7n nh\u1ea1c.", "id": "musiclibrary.import", "label": "Nh\u1eadp th\u01b0 vi\u1ec7n", "level": "advanced", "parent": "", "type": "action"}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "boolean", "type": "toggle"}, "default": true, "enabled": true, "help": "Hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb m\u1ee5c (..) trong danh s\u00e1ch \u0111\u1ec3 truy c\u1eadp th\u01b0 m\u1ee5c m\u1eb9.", "id": "filelists.showparentdiritems", "label": "Hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb c\u00e1c m\u1ee5c trong th\u01b0 m\u1ee5c cha", "level": "standard", "parent": "", "type": "boolean", "value": true}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "boolean", "type": "toggle"}, "default": true, "enabled": true, "help": "B\u1ecf qua c\u00e1c m\u00e3 th\u00f4ng b\u00e1o nh\u1ea5t \u0111\u1ecbnh, v\u00ed d\u1ee5: \"The\", trong c\u00e1c ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng s\u1eafp x\u1ebfp. \"The Simpsons\" ch\u1eb3ng h\u1ea1n s\u1ebd \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c s\u1eafp x\u1ebfp l\u00e0 \"Simpsons\".", "id": "filelists.ignorethewhensorting", "label": "B\u1ecf qua b\u00e0i vi\u1ebft khi s\u1eafp x\u1ebfp", "level": "standard", "parent": "", "type": "boolean", "value": true}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "boolean", "type": "toggle"}, "default": true, "enabled": true, "help": "Hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb ph\u1ea7n m\u1edf r\u1ed9ng c\u1ee7a t\u1eadp tin tr\u00ean t\u1eadp tin ph\u01b0\u01a1ng ti\u1ec7n, v\u00ed d\u1ee5 \"H\u00e3y Trao Cho Anh\" s\u1ebd \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb l\u00e0 \"H\u00e3y Trao Cho Anh.mp3\".", "id": "filelists.showextensions", "label": "Hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb ki\u1ec3u t\u1eadp tin", "level": "standard", "parent": "", "type": "boolean", "value": true}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "boolean", "type": "toggle"}, "default": true, "enabled": true, "help": "Hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb n\u00fat th\u00eam ngu\u1ed3n trong ph\u1ea7n g\u1ed1c c\u1ee7a giao di\u1ec7n ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng.", "id": "filelists.showaddsourcebuttons", "label": "Hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb n\u00fat \"Th\u00eam ngu\u1ed3n\"", "level": "standard", "parent": "", "type": "boolean", "value": true}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "boolean", "type": "toggle"}, "default": false, "enabled": true, "help": "Hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb t\u1eadp tin v\u00e0 th\u01b0 m\u1ee5c \u1ea9n khi li\u1ec7t k\u00ea c\u00e1c t\u1eadp tin.", "id": "filelists.showhidden", "label": "Hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb t\u1eadp tin v\u00e0 th\u01b0 m\u1ee5c \u1ea9n", "level": "advanced", "parent": "", "type": "boolean", "value": false}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "boolean", "type": "toggle"}, "default": false, "enabled": true, "help": "Cho ph\u00e9p x\u00f3a v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed5i t\u00ean t\u1eadp tin th\u00f4ng qua giao di\u1ec7n ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng, th\u00f4ng qua menu ng\u1eef c\u1ea3nh, v\u00ed d\u1ee5: nh\u1ea5n \"C\" tr\u00ean b\u00e0n ph\u00edm \u0111\u1ec3 hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb menu n\u00e0y.", "id": "filelists.allowfiledeletion", "label": "Cho ph\u00e9p \u0111\u1ed5i t\u00ean v\u00e0 x\u00f3a t\u1eadp tin", "level": "advanced", "parent": "", "type": "boolean", "value": false}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "string", "multiselect": false, "type": "list"}, "default": 1, "enabled": true, "help": "Toggle between [Choose], [Play] (default), [Resume], [Show information] and [Queue item].[CR][Choose] will open a context menu to select an item, e.g. show information.[CR][Play] will automatically play videos from the beginning or if a resume point is present ask whether to play from beginning or to resume.[CR][Resume] Will automatically resume videos from the last position that you were viewing them.[CR][Show information] will open the video's information dialog.[CR][Queue item] will append the video to the video playlist.", "id": "myvideos.selectaction", "label": "H\u00e0nh \u0111\u1ed9ng ch\u1ecdn m\u1eb7c \u0111\u1ecbnh", "level": "basic", "options": [{"label": "Ch\u1ecdn", "value": 0}, {"label": "Ph\u00e1t", "value": 1}, {"label": "Ti\u1ebfp t\u1ee5c", "value": 2}, {"label": "Hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb th\u00f4ng tin", "value": 3}, {"label": "M\u1ee5c ch\u1edd", "value": 7}], "parent": "", "type": "integer", "value": 1}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "boolean", "type": "toggle"}, "default": false, "enabled": true, "help": "Defines how to handle selection of videos with multiple versions.[CR][Enabled] Automatically select the default video version without prompting.[CR][Disabled] Display a dialogue to select a version of the video.", "id": "myvideos.selectdefaultversion", "label": "Select default video version", "level": "basic", "parent": "", "type": "boolean", "value": false}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "string", "multiselect": false, "type": "list"}, "default": 1, "enabled": true, "help": "Toggle between [Ask if resumable] (default) and [Resume].[CR][Ask if resumable] will ask whether to play from beginning or to resume (if a resume point is present).[CR][Resume] will automatically resume videos from the last position that you were viewing them.[CR]If no resume point is set, playback will automatically start from the beginning.", "id": "myvideos.playaction", "label": "Default play action", "level": "basic", "options": [{"label": "Ask if resumable", "value": 1}, {"label": "Ti\u1ebfp t\u1ee5c", "value": 2}], "parent": "", "type": "integer", "value": 1}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "boolean", "type": "toggle"}, "default": false, "enabled": true, "help": "Enable to use embedded tags in mp4 or mkv files for library metadata. Will prevent scrapers from operating correctly.", "id": "myvideos.usetags", "label": "S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng th\u1ebb video", "level": "advanced", "parent": "", "type": "boolean", "value": false}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "boolean", "type": "toggle"}, "default": true, "enabled": true, "help": "Tr\u00edch xu\u1ea5t th\u00f4ng tin t\u1eeb c\u01a1 s\u1edf d\u1eef li\u1ec7u nh\u01b0 codec v\u00e0 t\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 khung h\u00ecnh t\u1eeb video.", "id": "myvideos.extractflags", "label": "Tr\u00edch xu\u1ea5t th\u00f4ng tin video t\u1eeb t\u1eadp tin", "level": "advanced", "parent": "", "type": "boolean", "value": true}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "boolean", "type": "toggle"}, "default": true, "enabled": true, "help": "Tr\u00edch xu\u1ea5t h\u00ecnh thu nh\u1ecf c\u1ee7a ch\u01b0\u01a1ng \u0111\u1ec3 hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb trong m\u1edf \u0111\u1ea7u ch\u01b0\u01a1ng/d\u1ea5u trang. \u0110i\u1ec1u n\u00e0y c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 l\u00e0m t\u0103ng t\u1ea3i CPU.", "id": "myvideos.extractchapterthumbs", "label": "Tr\u00edch xu\u1ea5t h\u00ecnh thu nh\u1ecf c\u1ee7a ch\u01b0\u01a1ng", "level": "advanced", "parent": "", "type": "boolean", "value": true}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "boolean", "type": "toggle"}, "default": false, "enabled": true, "help": "K\u1ebft h\u1ee3p c\u00e1c t\u1ec7p video \u0111a ph\u1ea7n, th\u01b0 m\u1ee5c DVD ho\u1eb7c th\u01b0 m\u1ee5c phim, xu\u1ed1ng m\u1ed9t m\u1ee5c duy nh\u1ea5t trong ch\u1ebf \u0111\u1ed9 xem kh\u00f4ng ph\u1ea3i th\u01b0 vi\u1ec7n.", "id": "myvideos.stackvideos", "label": "K\u1ebft h\u1ee3p c\u00e1c m\u1ee5c video t\u00e1ch", "level": "standard", "parent": "", "type": "boolean", "value": false}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "boolean", "type": "toggle"}, "default": true, "enabled": true, "help": "Khi m\u1ed9t t\u1eadp tin \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c qu\u00e9t v\u00e0o th\u01b0 vi\u1ec7n, n\u00f3 s\u1ebd hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb ti\u00eau \u0111\u1ec1 trong c\u01a1 s\u1edf d\u1eef li\u1ec7u thay v\u00ec t\u00ean t\u1eadp tin.", "id": "myvideos.replacelabels", "label": "Thay th\u1ebf t\u00ean t\u1eadp tin b\u1eb1ng ti\u00eau \u0111\u1ec1 th\u01b0 vi\u1ec7n", "level": "standard", "parent": "", "type": "boolean", "value": true}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "boolean", "type": "toggle"}, "default": true, "enabled": true, "help": "Hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb m\u1ee5c \"T\u1ea5t c\u1ea3 m\u1ee5c\" trong th\u01b0 m\u1ee5c, v\u00ed d\u1ee5: \"T\u1ea5t c\u1ea3 album\" ho\u1eb7c \"T\u1ea5t c\u1ea3 m\u00f9a\".", "id": "videolibrary.showallitems", "label": "Hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb m\u1ee5c \"T\u1ea5t c\u1ea3 m\u1ee5c\"", "level": "advanced", "parent": "", "type": "boolean", "value": true}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "string", "multiselect": true, "type": "list"}, "default": [0, 1, 2], "definition": {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "string", "multiselect": true, "type": "list"}, "default": 0, "enabled": true, "help": "Show information for unwatched media in the video library or hide them if not selected to prevent spoilers. Available options are 'Movie plot', 'Episode plot' and 'Episode thumb'.", "id": "videolibrary.showunwatchedplots.definition", "label": "Hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb th\u00f4ng tin cho c\u00e1c m\u1ee5c ch\u01b0a xem", "level": "basic", "options": [{"label": "Lo\u1ea1t phim", "value": 0}, {"label": "Phim b\u1ed9", "value": 1}, {"label": "H\u00ecnh thu nh\u1ecf c\u1ee7a t\u1eadp", "value": 2}], "parent": "", "type": "integer", "value": 0}, "delimiter": ",", "elementtype": "integer", "enabled": true, "help": "Show information for unwatched media in the video library or hide them if not selected to prevent spoilers. Available options are 'Movie plot', 'Episode plot' and 'Episode thumb'.", "id": "videolibrary.showunwatchedplots", "label": "Hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb th\u00f4ng tin cho c\u00e1c m\u1ee5c ch\u01b0a xem", "level": "basic", "maximumItems": -1, "minimumItems": 0, "parent": "", "type": "list", "value": [0, 1, 2]}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "boolean", "type": "toggle"}, "default": false, "enabled": true, "help": "When enabled, movies belonging to a \"Movie set\" are grouped together under one entry for the set in the movie library, this entry can then be opened to display the individual movies. When disabled, each movie will have its own entry in the movie library even if it belongs to a set.", "id": "videolibrary.groupmoviesets", "label": "Hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb lo\u1ea1t phim", "level": "standard", "parent": "", "type": "boolean", "value": false}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "boolean", "type": "toggle"}, "default": false, "enabled": true, "help": "Khi b\u1eadt, m\u1ee5c \"Lo\u1ea1t phim\" \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng ngay c\u1ea3 khi th\u01b0 vi\u1ec7n phim ch\u1ec9 ch\u1ee9a m\u1ed9t phim t\u1eeb lo\u1ea1t phim \u0111\u00f3. Khi t\u1eaft, m\u1ee5c \"Lo\u1ea1t phim\" ch\u1ec9 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng n\u1ebfu th\u01b0 vi\u1ec7n phim ch\u1ee9a nhi\u1ec1u phim t\u1eeb lo\u1ea1t phim \u0111\u00f3.", "id": "videolibrary.groupsingleitemsets", "label": "Bao g\u1ed3m c\u00e1c lo\u1ea1t phim ch\u1ee9a m\u1ed9t phim duy nh\u1ea5t", "level": "standard", "parent": "", "type": "boolean", "value": false}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "boolean", "type": "toggle"}, "default": false, "enabled": true, "help": "When enabled, a video with multiple versions will be shown as a folder in the video library. This folder can then be opened to display the individual video versions. When disabled, the configured select action will be applied.", "id": "videolibrary.showvideoversionsasfolder", "label": "Show videos with multiple versions as folder", "level": "standard", "parent": "", "type": "boolean", "value": false}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "boolean", "type": "toggle"}, "default": false, "enabled": true, "help": "X\u00f3a ti\u00eau \u0111\u1ec1, th\u1ec3 lo\u1ea1i, vv kh\u1ecfi ch\u1ebf \u0111\u1ed9 xem th\u01b0 vi\u1ec7n. Ch\u1ecdn m\u1ed9t danh m\u1ee5c s\u1ebd \u0111\u01b0a b\u1ea1n th\u1eb3ng \u0111\u1ebfn ch\u1ebf \u0111\u1ed9 xem ti\u00eau \u0111\u1ec1.", "id": "myvideos.flatten", "label": "Ph\u00e2n c\u1ea5p ph\u1eb3ng", "level": "advanced", "parent": "", "type": "boolean", "value": false}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "string", "multiselect": false, "type": "list"}, "default": 1, "enabled": true, "help": "Ch\u1ecdn trong tr\u01b0\u1eddng h\u1ee3p b\u1ea1n mu\u1ed1n \u1ea9n c\u00e1c n\u00fat m\u00f9a c\u1ee7a ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh TV. N\u1ebfu \u1ea9n, ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh TV \u0111\u00e3 ch\u1ecdn s\u1ebd tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp nh\u1ea3y v\u00e0o ch\u1ebf \u0111\u1ed9 xem t\u1eadp.", "id": "videolibrary.flattentvshows", "label": "Flatten TV show seasons", "level": "advanced", "options": [{"label": "Kh\u00f4ng bao gi\u1edd", "value": 0}, {"label": "N\u1ebfu ch\u1ec9 m\u1ed9t m\u00f9a", "value": 1}, {"label": "Lu\u00f4n lu\u00f4n", "value": 2}], "parent": "", "type": "integer", "value": 1}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "boolean", "type": "toggle"}, "default": true, "enabled": true, "help": "Hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh TV kh\u00f4ng c\u00f3 t\u1eadp khi duy\u1ec7t th\u01b0 vi\u1ec7n video.", "id": "videolibrary.showemptytvshows", "label": "Hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh TV tr\u1ed1ng", "level": "advanced", "parent": "", "type": "boolean", "value": true}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "string", "multiselect": false, "type": "list"}, "default": 0, "enabled": true, "help": "When entering a TV show season or episode view automatically select the first unwatched season or episode.[CR][On first entry] The first unwatched item will be selected only when a view is entered for the first time.[CR][Always] The first unwatched item will be selected every time a view is entered.", "id": "videolibrary.tvshowsselectfirstunwatcheditem", "label": "Select first unwatched TV show season / episode", "level": "advanced", "options": [{"label": "Kh\u00f4ng bao gi\u1edd", "value": 0}, {"label": "V\u00e0o m\u1ee5c \u0111\u1ea7u ti\u00ean", "value": 1}, {"label": "Lu\u00f4n lu\u00f4n", "value": 2}], "parent": "", "type": "integer", "value": 0}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "string", "multiselect": false, "type": "list"}, "default": 0, "enabled": false, "help": "Whether or not to consider the items from \"All seasons\" and \"Specials\" in the unwatched item selection.", "id": "videolibrary.tvshowsincludeallseasonsandspecials", "label": "Bao g\u1ed3m \"T\u1ea5t c\u1ea3 m\u00f9a\" v\u00e0 \"\u0110\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t\"", "level": "advanced", "options": [{"label": "Neither", "value": 0}, {"label": "Both", "value": 1}, {"label": "Ch\u1ec9 \"T\u1ea5t c\u1ea3 c\u00e1c M\u00f9a\"", "value": 2}, {"label": "Ch\u1ec9 \"T\u1eadp \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t\"", "value": 3}], "parent": "videolibrary.tvshowsselectfirstunwatcheditem", "type": "integer", "value": 0}, {"allowempty": true, "allownewoption": false, "control": {"delayed": false, "format": "path", "heading": "Duy\u1ec7t th\u01b0 m\u1ee5c", "type": "button"}, "default": "", "enabled": true, "help": "Ch\u1ecdn th\u01b0 m\u1ee5c l\u01b0u th\u00f4ng tin lo\u1ea1t phim (h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh) tr\u00ean thi\u1ebft b\u1ecb.", "id": "videolibrary.moviesetsfolder", "label": "Th\u01b0 m\u1ee5c th\u00f4ng tin lo\u1ea1t phim", "level": "standard", "parent": "", "sources": ["files", "pictures", "videos"], "type": "path", "value": "", "writable": false}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "boolean", "type": "toggle"}, "default": true, "enabled": true, "help": "When enabled, shows all performers in the artist list for music videos, not just the main artist", "id": "videolibrary.musicvideosallperformers", "label": "Show all performers for music videos", "level": "standard", "parent": "", "type": "boolean", "value": true}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "string", "multiselect": false, "type": "list"}, "default": 0, "enabled": true, "help": "S\u1ed1 l\u01b0\u1ee3ng \u1ea3nh minh h\u1ecda \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ch\u1ecdn t\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed9ng - [T\u1ed1i \u0111a] t\u1ea5t c\u1ea3 h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh c\u1ee5c b\u1ed9 v\u00e0 \u1ea3nh minh h\u1ecda t\u1eeb xa; [C\u01a1 b\u1ea3n] ti\u1ebft ki\u1ec7m dung l\u01b0\u1ee3ng tr\u00ean c\u00e1c thi\u1ebft b\u1ecb h\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf ho\u1eb7c khi s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng m\u1ed9t giao di\u1ec7n \u0111\u01a1n gi\u1ea3n; [T\u00f9y ch\u1ec9nh] \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u1ecbnh c\u1ea5u h\u00ecnh b\u1edfi ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng \u0111\u1ec3 ki\u1ec3m so\u00e1t chi ti\u1ebft; [Kh\u00f4ng] kh\u00f4ng c\u00f3 \u1ea3nh", "id": "videolibrary.artworklevel", "label": "M\u1ee9c \u0111\u1ed9 \u1ea3nh minh h\u1ecda", "level": "standard", "options": [{"label": "T\u1ed1i \u0111a", "value": 0}, {"label": "C\u01a1 b\u1ea3n", "value": 1}, {"label": "Tu\u1ef3 ch\u1ec9nh", "value": 2}, {"label": "Kh\u00f4ng", "value": 3}], "parent": "", "type": "integer", "value": 0}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "boolean", "type": "toggle"}, "default": true, "enabled": true, "help": "T\u1ea3i h\u00ecnh thu nh\u1ecf cho c\u00e1c di\u1ec5n vi\u00ean t\u1eeb c\u01a1 s\u1edf d\u1eef li\u1ec7u tr\u1ef1c tuy\u1ebfn khi th\u00eam ph\u01b0\u01a1ng ti\u1ec7n v\u00e0o th\u01b0 vi\u1ec7n.", "id": "videolibrary.actorthumbs", "label": "T\u1ea3i xu\u1ed1ng h\u00ecnh thu nh\u1ecf c\u1ee7a di\u1ec5n vi\u00ean", "level": "advanced", "parent": "", "type": "boolean", "value": true}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "boolean", "type": "toggle"}, "default": true, "enabled": true, "help": "Tr\u00edch xu\u1ea5t h\u00ecnh thu nh\u1ecf \u0111\u1ec3 hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb trong ch\u1ebf \u0111\u1ed9 th\u01b0 vi\u1ec7n.", "id": "myvideos.extractthumb", "label": "Tr\u00edch xu\u1ea5t h\u00ecnh thu nh\u1ecf t\u1eeb t\u1eadp tin video", "level": "standard", "parent": "", "type": "boolean", "value": true}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "boolean", "type": "toggle"}, "default": true, "enabled": true, "help": "Hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb m\u1ee5c \"T\u1ea5t c\u1ea3 m\u1ee5c\" trong th\u01b0 m\u1ee5c, v\u00ed d\u1ee5: \"T\u1ea5t c\u1ea3 album\" ho\u1eb7c \"T\u1ea5t c\u1ea3 m\u00f9a\".", "id": "musiclibrary.showallitems", "label": "Hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb m\u1ee5c \"T\u1ea5t c\u1ea3 m\u1ee5c\"", "level": "advanced", "parent": "", "type": "boolean", "value": true}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "boolean", "type": "toggle"}, "default": true, "enabled": true, "help": "Khi b\u1eadt, c\u1ea3 ca s\u0129 b\u00e0i h\u00e1t v\u00e0 album \u0111\u1ec1u \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb. Khi t\u1eaft, ch\u1ec9 album ca s\u0129 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb v\u00e0 c\u00e1c ca s\u0129 ch\u1ec9 xu\u1ea5t hi\u1ec7n tr\u00ean b\u00e0i h\u00e1t ri\u00eang l\u1ebb trong album s\u1ebd b\u1ecb lo\u1ea1i tr\u1eeb.", "id": "musiclibrary.showcompilationartists", "label": "Hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb b\u00e0i h\u00e1t v\u00e0 album ca s\u0129", "level": "basic", "parent": "", "type": "boolean", "value": true}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "boolean", "type": "toggle"}, "default": true, "enabled": true, "help": "Khi b\u1eadt, m\u1edf m\u1ed9t album nhi\u1ec1u \u0111\u0129a s\u1ebd hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb c\u00e1c \u0111\u0129a d\u01b0\u1edbi d\u1ea1ng c\u00e1c m\u1ee5c ri\u00eang l\u1ebb thay v\u00ec t\u1ea5t c\u1ea3 c\u00e1c b\u00e0i h\u00e1t. M\u1edf m\u1ed9t \u0111\u0129a sau \u0111\u00f3 hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb c\u00e1c b\u00e0i h\u00e1t tr\u00ean \u0111\u0129a \u0111\u00f3.", "id": "musiclibrary.showdiscs", "label": "T\u00e1ch album th\u00e0nh t\u1eebng \u0111\u0129a", "level": "basic", "parent": "", "type": "boolean", "value": true}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "boolean", "type": "toggle"}, "default": false, "enabled": true, "help": "Khi s\u1eafp x\u1ebfp c\u00e1c m\u1ee5c nh\u1ea1c theo ngh\u1ec7 s\u0129, h\u00e3y s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng t\u00ean s\u1eafp x\u1ebfp, v\u00ed d\u1ee5: Parton, Dolly ch\u1ee9 kh\u00f4ng ph\u1ea3i t\u00ean.", "id": "musiclibrary.useartistsortname", "label": "S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng t\u00ean ngh\u1ec7 s\u0129 khi s\u1eafp x\u1ebfp theo ngh\u1ec7 s\