uan", "level": "basic", "parent": "", "type": "addon", "value": ""}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "string", "multiselect": false, "type": "list"}, "default": 1, "enabled": true, "help": "\u0110\u1ecdc th\u00f4ng tin ReplayGain \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c m\u00e3 h\u00f3a trong c\u00e1c t\u1eadp tin \u00e2m thanh c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n b\u1eb1ng m\u1ed9t ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh nh\u01b0 MP3Gain v\u00e0 chu\u1ea9n h\u00f3a c\u00e1c m\u1ee9c \u00e2m thanh t\u01b0\u01a1ng \u1ee9ng.", "id": "musicplayer.replaygaintype", "label": "\u0110i\u1ec1u ch\u1ec9nh \u00e2m l\u01b0\u1ee3ng", "level": "expert", "options": [{"label": "T\u1eaft", "value": 0}, {"label": "D\u00f9ng m\u1ee9c c\u1ee7a b\u00e0i h\u00e1t", "value": 2}, {"label": "D\u00f9ng m\u1ee9c c\u1ee7a album", "value": 1}], "parent": "", "type": "integer", "value": 1}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "string", "formatlabel": "{0:d}.0 dB", "type": "spinner"}, "default": 89, "enabled": true, "help": "\u00c2m l\u01b0\u1ee3ng tham chi\u1ebfu (m\u1ee9c PreAmp) \u0111\u1ec3 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng cho t\u1eadp tin c\u00f3 th\u00f4ng tin ReplayGain \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c m\u00e3 h\u00f3a. M\u1eb7c \u0111\u1ecbnh l\u00e0 89dB theo ti\u00eau chu\u1ea9n. Thay \u0111\u1ed5i m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch th\u1eadn tr\u1ecdng.", "id": "musicplayer.replaygainpreamp", "label": "T\u1eadp tin v\u1edbi th\u00f4ng tin ReplayGain", "level": "expert", "maximum": 101, "minimum": 77, "parent": "musicplayer.replaygaintype", "step": 1, "type": "integer", "value": 89}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "string", "formatlabel": "{0:d}.0 dB", "type": "spinner"}, "default": 89, "enabled": true, "help": "Reference volume (PreAmp level) to use for files without encoded ReplayGain information. Default is 89dB as per standard. Change with caution.", "id": "musicplayer.replaygainnogainpreamp", "label": "T\u1eadp tin kh\u00f4ng c\u00f3 th\u00f4ng tin ReplayGain", "level": "expert", "maximum": 101, "minimum": 77, "parent": "musicplayer.replaygaintype", "step": 1, "type": "integer", "value": 89}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "boolean", "type": "toggle"}, "default": false, "enabled": true, "help": "Play file at lower volume, if necessary, to avoid audio limiting clipping protection. Otherwise clipping protection will be provided by the audioengine in those parts that need it.", "id": "musicplayer.replaygainavoidclipping", "label": "H\u1ee7y ch\u1ed1ng c\u1eaft tr\u00ean t\u1eadp tin ReplayGained", "level": "expert", "parent": "musicplayer.replaygaintype", "type": "boolean", "value": false}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "boolean", "type": "toggle"}, "default": false, "enabled": true, "help": "T\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed9ng quay video DVD khi \u0111\u01b0a v\u00e0o \u1ed5 \u0111\u0129a.", "id": "dvds.autorun", "label": "T\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed9ng ch\u01a1i DVD", "level": "basic", "parent": "", "type": "boolean", "value": false}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "string", "formatlabel": "{}", "minimumlabel": "T\u1eaft", "type": "spinner"}, "default": 0, "enabled": true, "help": "B\u1eaft bu\u1ed9c m\u1ed9t v\u00f9ng \u0111\u1ec3 ph\u00e1t l\u1ea1i DVD.", "id": "dvds.playerregion", "label": "B\u1eaft bu\u1ed9c khu v\u1ef1c \u0111\u0129a DVD", "level": "standard", "maximum": 8, "minimum": 0, "parent": "", "step": 1, "type": "integer", "value": 0}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "boolean", "type": "toggle"}, "default": false, "enabled": true, "help": "C\u1ed1 g\u1eafng b\u1ecf qua ph\u1ea7n gi\u1edbi thi\u1ec7u \"Kh\u00f4ng th\u1ec3 b\u1ecf qua\" tr\u01b0\u1edbc menu DVD.", "id": "dvds.automenu", "label": "C\u1ed1 g\u1eafng b\u1ecf qua ph\u1ea7n gi\u1edbi thi\u1ec7u tr\u01b0\u1edbc menu DVD", "level": "advanced", "parent": "", "type": "boolean", "value": false}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "string", "formatlabel": "{}", "type": "spinner"}, "default": 1, "enabled": true, "help": "Khu v\u1ef1c A - Ch\u00e2u M\u1ef9, \u0110\u00f4ng \u00c1 v\u00e0 \u0110\u00f4ng Nam \u00c1. Khu v\u1ef1