rt", "options": [{"label": "No background", "value": 0}, {"label": "Shadow", "value": 1}, {"label": "Box", "value": 2}, {"label": "Square box", "value": 3}], "parent": "", "type": "integer", "value": 0}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "percentage", "formatlabel": "{:.2f} %", "popup": false, "type": "slider"}, "default": 4.95, "enabled": true, "help": "Cho ph\u00e9p b\u1ea1n th\u00eam l\u1ec1 trong v\u0103n b\u1ea3n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c c\u0103n ch\u1ec9nh tr\u00ean c\u00f9ng v\u00e0 d\u01b0\u1edbi c\u00f9ng.  Vi\u1ec7c thay \u0111\u1ed5i c\u00e0i \u0111\u1eb7t n\u00e0y c\u0169ng s\u1ebd \u1ea3nh h\u01b0\u1edfng \u0111\u1ebfn v\u1ecb tr\u00ed ph\u1ee5 \u0111\u1ec1 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u1eb7t v\u1edbi Hi\u1ec7u ch\u1ec9nh video.", "id": "subtitles.marginvertical", "label": "Vertical margin", "level": "expert", "maximum": 50.0, "minimum": 0.0, "parent": "", "step": 0.05, "type": "number", "value": 4.95}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "boolean", "type": "toggle"}, "default": false, "enabled": true, "help": "Ghi \u0111\u00e8 ph\u00f4ng ch\u1eef ph\u1ee5 \u0111\u1ec1 \u1edf \u0111\u1ecbnh d\u1ea1ng ph\u1ee5 \u0111\u1ec1 nh\u01b0 ASS / SSA.", "id": "subtitles.overridefonts", "label": "Ghi \u0111\u00e8 ph\u00f4ng ch\u1eef ph\u1ee5 \u0111\u1ec1", "level": "expert", "parent": "", "type": "boolean", "value": false}, {"control": {"delayed": false, "format": "string", "multiselect": false, "type": "list"}, "default": 0, "enabled": true, "help": "M\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 \u0111\u1ecbnh d\u1ea1ng ph\u1ee5 \u0111\u1ec1 nh\u01b0 SSA / ASS / WebVTT c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 bao g\u1ed3m si\u00eau d\u1eef li\u1ec7u nh\u01b0 ki\u1ec3u ph\u00f4ng ch\u1eef, m\u00e0u s\u1eafc, k\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc, c\u0103n ch\u1ec9nh, v\u1ecb tr\u00ed, v.v. b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 ghi \u0111\u00e8 c\u00e1c ki\u1ec3u b\u1eb1ng c\u00e1c t\u00f9y ch\u1ec9nh c\u1ee7a m\u00ecnh (xin l\u01b0u \u00fd r\u1eb1ng m\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 tr\u01b0\u1eddng h\u1ee3p c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 x\u1ea3y ra t\u00e1c d\u1e